WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:00.990
- Well, I have to ask,

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:03.290
how do you feel about being a popular meme

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:04.440
in the last few years?

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.260
Because there's a lot of good ones,

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:08.120
there's you sipping tea.

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:09.250
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.460
As they say in the social media circles,

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:14.104
it's not that easy being meme.

00:00:14.104 --> 00:00:16.560
(Kelly laughs)
But, you know,

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:17.393
there's something about a frog

00:00:17.393 --> 00:00:19.640
sipping tea that speaks to everybody.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.340
- This is like a little
star Wars kind of thing.

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.350
I like this one.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.200
- Yeah, that's a picture of,

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.540
that's me and my evil
doppelganger, Constantine the Frog,

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.010
from "Muppets Most Wanted."

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:30.220
- Oh my God, I love it.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:31.330
I love it.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.270
Well, it's been a challenging year.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:36.140
So what do the Muppets
want everyone to know?

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:39.530
- You know what, Kelly, I
think we've all discovered

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:43.640
that even when we're not
together in the same place,

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:46.800
we can still check in with each other

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:47.820
and take care of each other

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:49.560
and if we do that every day,

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:50.880
then we'll get through this

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:53.681
and we'll be a bit
better for it, you know?

00:00:53.681 --> 00:00:55.153
- Yeah. I love the optimism.

